ession is pretty fast now.\r\n\r\nAs an aside, images get slightly more contrasted when compressed with etcpak (with or without this PR). This doesn't occur with Betsy.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123940#pullrequestreview-5343017132","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123940","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123940#pullrequestreview-5343017132"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123940"}},"submitted_at":"2026-09-28T18:31:48Z","commit_id":"0af22f2679586ff74f15dc889a082bd39ed3d0c5"},{"id":5344511301,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPo7FRQ","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?u=e44a465cbebabb9ea2be80b59e6dc07966bef5b7&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Looks great! The final step before merging is to squash all the commits together so that the whole PR only contains 1 big commit with all your changes. We like to merge one commit at a time to keep the git history clean and navigable. \n\nIf you don't know how to do that, 